{"3352950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Paradox", "steam_appid": 3352950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352950/extras/272321f1388dda754ba7873645a8ea52.poster.avif?t=1788200986\" width=426 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352950/extras/272321f1388dda754ba7873645a8ea52.webm?t=1788200986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352950/extras/272321f1388dda754ba7873645a8ea52.mp4?t=1788200986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Paradox is a <strong>1v4 asymmetric multiplayer</strong> experience where <strong>superpowered survivors</strong> face off against <strong>deadly Hunter </strong>across fractured timelines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match drops players into a different era, from cursed pyramids in ancient Egypt to the fog covered streets of Victorian London. Survivors must work together to complete map specific objectives, outsmart the Hunter, and escape before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But surviving won't be easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each survivor wields unique supernatural abilities that change how they play. Teleport across danger, unleash electric attacks, manipulate shadows, rescue injured teammates, or support your squad during intense chases. Teamwork, stealth, and timing are the keys to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile, the Hunter is built to dominate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track survivors across the map, unleash devastating powers like laser beams and rage mode, and stop anyone attempting to escape the timeline alive. Every Hunter ability is designed to pressure survivors and force them into impossible decisions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">-------------What to Expect:-------------</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352950/extras/d2633f1f30b111d582abd23df65d86fc.poster.avif?t=1788200986\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352950/extras/d2633f1f30b111d582abd23df65d86fc.webm?t=1788200986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352950/extras/d2633f1f30b111d582abd23df65d86fc.mp4?t=1788200986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 1v4 online asymmetric multiplayer<br>• Unique survivor and Hunter powers<br>• Objective-driven gameplay across multiple timelines<br>• Stealth, combat, teamwork, and high-pressure chases<br>• Diverse maps inspired by different historical eras<br>• Survivor rescue and carry mechanics<br>• Multiple playstyles with evolving strategies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every timeline tells a different story.<br>Every match becomes a fight for survival.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352950/extras/b7e6370a5abe4cc6d99610cd5cb9c748.avif?t=1788200986\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And somewhere across time...<br>something is hunting you.<br><br>----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Time doesn’t care who you are.</strong><br>But if you’re smart, fast, and just a little ruthless…<br>You might make it out alive.<br><br>Will you?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352950/extras/272321f1388dda754ba7873645a8ea52.poster.avif?t=1788200986\" width=426 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352950/extras/272321f1388dda754ba7873645a8ea52.webm?t=1788200986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352950/extras/272321f1388dda754ba7873645a8ea52.mp4?t=1788200986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Paradox is a <strong>1v4 asymmetric multiplayer</strong> experience where <strong>superpowered survivors</strong> face off against <strong>deadly Hunter </strong>across fractured timelines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match drops players into a different era, from cursed pyramids in ancient Egypt to the fog covered streets of Victorian London. Survivors must work together to complete map specific objectives, outsmart the Hunter, and escape before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But surviving won't be easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each survivor wields unique supernatural abilities that change how they play. Teleport across danger, unleash electric attacks, manipulate shadows, rescue injured teammates, or support your squad during intense chases. Teamwork, stealth, and timing are the keys to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile, the Hunter is built to dominate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track survivors across the map, unleash devastating powers like laser beams and rage mode, and stop anyone attempting to escape the timeline alive. Every Hunter ability is designed to pressu