, fast, and just a little ruthless…<br>You might make it out alive.<br><br>Will you?</p>", "short_description": "One player hunts. Four players run and fight back with superpowers. Use unique abilities, complete objectives, and escape through ancient Egypt, Victorian London, and more.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352950/42d3e42f414ebdbc06c8cc4fcad691c07034cf9d/header.jpg?t=1788200986", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352950/8ee5717d9c0cab7d3663eb3b87869d7b308eaedc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788200986", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352950/8ee5717d9c0cab7d3663eb3b87869d7b308eaedc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788200986", "website": "https://www.crystalshinegames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 6600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 970 or AMD Radeon RX 470<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 6600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Crystal Shine Games"], "publishers": ["Crystal Shine Games"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categorie